; The ONE variable: `internationalization/rendering/force_right_to_left_layout_direction`,
; which lives in this directory's own project.godot because no .tscn can carry
; a project setting. Both rows say `layout_direction = 1` (APPLICATION_LOCALE);
; `Control::is_layout_rtl` reads the force flag ahead of the locale on that arm
; (control.cpp:3610-3614), so the flag alone decides the answer and the locale —
; which this previewer cannot read off the host — never enters. Invisible in
; every loose fixture: without a project.godot the flag is false and this scene
; renders exactly like its left-to-right neighbour.

